  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Support Measures for Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The global objective (impact) is to support the actions of the Delegation related to Climate Change and the environment and to the research Ecuadorian public policies and initiatives in these topics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. To provide the Delegation and partner entities with information and knowledge in relation to national and international public policies, specifically NDCs implementation, and climate change and environmental policies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2. To carry out analytical studies of projects and initiatives of the private or public sector related to environmental sustainability in areas of biodiversity, mining, transport, agriculture, aquaculture, industry, and urban development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3.To monitor compliance with COPs commitments, NDCs and related sector policies for Ecuador and EU-funded initiatives on climate change and the environment.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
